WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.300
TO ENEMY SHIPS AND ENEMY LANDS

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.860
"To Enemy Ships and Enemy Lands".

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:43.800
You went off on your own again, didn't you?!

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:44.800
Yes, sir!

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.660
Ow!

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.460
That's all! I don't have any more time to waste on you!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.660
We're still in Zanscare's air defense zone!

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.130
Remain on scramble standby!

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.200
Yes, sir!

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:59.730
Don't assume getting punched means this is over.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:00.860
I know.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.800
You've been really thoughtless, huh?

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:06.260
Yeah. You're planning to go back to Zanscare again, aren't you?

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.200
That's not...

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.200
Then hurry up! If you have to do something, do it!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.060
Yes!

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.760
They see through me. That's not good.

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.360
They're back!

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.330
Even after I said I could do it...

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.600
Support Units 1, 2, and 5.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.460
Unit 6, look after the damaged Unit 2, especially.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.100
Sir!

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:00.500
Lieutenant Cronicle!

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:01.430
What?

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.100
It's Captain Tassilo.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.660
Switch to audio.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.560
Good news, Lieutenant.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:11.300
The returning Mutterma Sugan Fleet just sent word that they've picked up...

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:15.430
...a vessel that seems to be trying to escape from Side 2's airspace.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.430
It must be the Reineforce.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.130
In all likelihood, yes.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:22.160
Roger that, sir. I'll go out with the Contio Team.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.230
Please do.

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.460
Call up data on support personnel.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.200
Yes, sir.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:28.630
Let's discuss our formation.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.500
Sir! Sir!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.060
The lieutenant is desperate for change.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:43.360
Begin sequential launch, starting with the reloaded units!

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.830
Open forward hatch! Mobile suits, exiting!

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:49.760
A detachment of ships from the survivors of the Zanscare fleet...

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:53.560
...that engaged the Side 2 allied fleet are headed towards us.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:57.830
However, there's only one squadron blocking our path.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:00.130
If we take our time breaking through them,

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:03.460
we'll end up facing every mobile suit in the fleet, right?

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:03.900
Right.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.300
I'd like to avoid that.

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:10.000
Because an enemy fresh off a major battle can be frightening.

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.430
Oliver, moving out!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.630
Marbet, Zoloat, moving out!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.330
Shrike Team 2, Junko, moving out!

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:25.860
Üso Ewin, Gundam! Here I go!

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:37.300
Confirmed, mobile suit units have cleared the firing path!

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:39.130
Launch missiles!

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:48.630
Who's there?

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.160
It's Peggie, kid.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.230
A wounded enemy has already been through a lot, so they can be scary.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:58.300
The Side 2 allied fleet didn't withdraw without a fight, huh?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.800
Of course not.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:03.400
If this becomes a full-scale war, even Zanscare would be easy to...

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.900
Üso, cover me for now!

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:08.760
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.160
There's interference on my display!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.030
Miss Peggie!

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:19.330
Not bad!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:26.660
There!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.130
Thanks. We make a good team, Üso.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.800
Um... Y-Yeah!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.760
Before anything else, you have to protect our home,

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.860
or else you won't be able to go looking for that girl again.

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:44.230
Right.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:46.600
This is the first time you've had...

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.600
...a home and people to go back to.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:49.300
Yeah.

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:53.230
If you understand that, then I think you could become a Newtype.

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:55.060
A Newtype?

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.500
It's coming from Zanscare!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.530
Those crow beaks are pretty good!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.560
Damn! They've taken the Reineforce's rear!

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:21.600
We've been flanked!

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.630
You're not getting away, Reineforce!

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.700
I can see Miss Peggie and the rest of Shrike Team!

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:39.930
If I don't protect our home, I'll never see Shahkti again!

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:46.660
Their teamwork's improving.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:50.730
Why isn't the fleet that's blocking the Reineforce's path attacking?

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:54.400
Mobile suits have dispersed! Fire all the mega-particle cannons!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:06.430
Increase barrier output to maximum! Take evasive maneuvers!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:09.130
Oliver and the others will do something. Hang on!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:13.000
Won't the allied fleet that withdrew from Side 2 help us?!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.030
You can't depend on an ally who's retreating!

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:19.400
What's the real Jinn Jahannam doing?

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.860
I thought you were Jinn Jahannam!

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.760
Um, well, that's actually the League Militaire's...

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:29.300
Admirals don't cry! Take the conn!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.600
Captain Gomez!

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:37.960
Ow!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:40.100
We'd better get into normal suits.

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:40.630
Yeah.

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.760
You two! You're free, right?

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:43.760
As it seems.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:44.600
Follow me.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:49.330
They're using their numbers to disrupt us. Üso, move around more!

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.200
Cover this area!

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:52.260
Sure thing!

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:57.700
Okay. I believe in what that kid can do.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.400
It's using the white one's parts?!

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.900
Take care of it, Captain Gomez.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:08.830
What?

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:12.800
Üso's prepared to sacrifice his unit! He'll need a spare!

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:14.000
Roger!

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:17.330
Separate the rest of the Victory segments for him, right?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:18.460
It's moving.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.130
I screwed up!

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:34.030
Even with a weapon this powerful, they still got me?!

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.000
You won't get away with this!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:51.300
Miss Peggie is like a precious big sister to me!

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:55.160
The white one's incorrigible! Take this!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:05.200
He's breaking out to form a wall?

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:19.430
I'll make sure you never dock again!

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.430
He got my Dash pack!

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:31.500
Üso's amazing... Assisting!

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:35.160
Üso... That kid's so heroic!

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:43.960
I wish we could let him go back to Zanscare!

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.300
A Zoloat?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.460
Odelo! Please!

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:56.530
Grab it, Üso!

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:00.600
Nice timing!

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.000
I'll use Üso's tactic!

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:31.700
Oliver just jettisoned his parts into the enemy cruiser.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:35.430
Even Oliver's picking up Üso's crazy habits!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.900
It's thrilling! I almost don't want to tell the women about this feeling.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.760
Okay, they've opened an escape route! All ahead, full!

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:46.700
If that's all right with you.

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:47.900
Oh, of course!

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.730
Where's Peggie? What about Peggie?

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:59.530
Junko, defending the Reineforce comes first! Hold your position!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.260
But what about Peggie?!

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:03.030
Üso went to get her.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.760
That boy? He went to get Peggie?

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.430
I have you now.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:17.600
Say your prayers!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.160
Üso's Gundam?!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:44.360
Miss Peggie, get out of here!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.900
Time after time, the white one appears!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.160
Beam sabers can also be used like this!

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.560
He didn't dodge that?

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:09.200
These pilots aren't used to Contios! They can't beat him!

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:10.630
Retreat!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:13.800
Running away?!

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:19.100
Blinders?!

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.430
The Fishbone?

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:27.700
Don't chase them!

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.500
Did you just set off those flares, Odelo?

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.500
Don't go out too far on your own!

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:34.400
You're too worked up, Üso!

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:35.330
They're right!

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:38.760
The main fleet is behind the fleet ahead of the Reineforce Junior.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.630
If you go after them alone, it'll be disastrous!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:42.960
Didn't you notice?

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.200
Yeah, you're right. The main fleet...

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:50.130
Miss Peggie? Where are you? Miss Marbet?

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:57.000
Peggie's all right. Help me get her aboard the Fishbone.

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:58.060
R-Right!

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.960
Aren't the painkillers working?

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.100
It's just proof I'm still alive.

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:11.630
I'm sorry. I didn't have my priorities in line,

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:13.960
and Miss Peggie got hurt because of it.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:18.200
There you go, making it all about you, again. I do my job for my own sake.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.300
Peggie!

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:23.300
You never change! Here, eat!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:27.360
A pilot has a duty to keep up his strength.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.330
And thanks to all your efforts,

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:33.960
the Reineforce Junior was able to clear an escape route.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.700
The kid still wants to go back to Zanscare.

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:37.500
Yeah.

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:41.600
No way. During the battle, I totally forgot about that.

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:43.900
Either way, we can't right now.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.760
We can't go back to the Reineforce Junior, because...

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.600
...the main BESPA fleet that's headed back to the Zanscare homeland,

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:51.530
is now right in front of us.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.460
So, we made a mistake by rushing out here, huh?

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:57.200
We didn't make a mistake!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.330
But...

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:02.700
What should we do? Miss Peggie needs a doctor, fast!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:06.700
But moving quickly will make us easy to spot by the enemy...

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:10.360
Of course! How about we infiltrate Zanscare...

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:12.960
...and then shake things up from the inside?

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:14.760
But, what about Miss Peggie?

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:16.560
She's stable for now.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:19.660
We could also hand her over to the Zanscare Red Cross.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.500
In any case, soldiers in a space fleet returning home...

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:27.900
...would never notice a small vessel drifting like a meteor.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.560
That's crazy!

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:32.660
We could disguise ourselves as a damaged military vessel!

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:33.600
Yeah!

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:35.700
You're right,

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:39.260
but are you prepared to taste Captain Gomez's fist later?

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:40.460
It'll hurt.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.730
I'll take the punch for you, Elisha.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:43.760
Thanks.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:46.060
Everything is about making yourself look cool...

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:55.330
Since this was a Zanscare vessel, with a little color camouflage...

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.260
They'll never notice us from a distance!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.360
Üso, board the Gundam!

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.200
Right!

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.800
Grab onto an enemy ship.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:49.260
What about the Gun EZ we're carrying?

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.600
They'll think it's a captured enemy suit.

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:54.530
We even planned for that!

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:56.430
We can release the dummy balloon now, right?

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:58.500
We're in the fleet's blind spot.

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:11.760
Odelo! Miss Peggie just left!

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.660
Why'd she leave on her own?!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.230
She must have been thinking of our safety!

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:18.560
She's in no condition to do that!

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:20.400
And we can't use the radio.

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.300
I'll latch onto the side!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.660
It's hot.

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:44.300
We can make it to the port entrance like this.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.160
Miss Peggie, why are you...

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:51.430
You didn't expect me to sleep, did you?

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:55.100
We gotta fix this ship by the end of the fiscal year?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.360
You need to rest!

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.400
I know.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.200
I'll go check things out.

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:11.530
You really can't sit still, can you, kid?

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:13.560
Hey! You can see it clearly from here!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:17.660
We're finally home! Nice to see the old home colony!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:19.200
Who are you?

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:20.530
A Federation soldier?!

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:25.800
No, it's a kid. Where'd you come from?

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.660
Look... I couldn't stand it anymore!

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:28.560
What?

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.300
My toilet pack's full,

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.130
and I'm getting pee in the bottom half of my suit!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.630
I'm looking for my parents.

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:38.930
I'm sorry I snuck aboard, but I need to pee!

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:40.160
How filthy!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.460
A refugee?

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:44.100
Today's the celebration. We can let it pass.

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.700
Should we lock him up?

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.260
We're about to enter port.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.100
We need to line up!

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.300
Colony air smells delicious!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:07.200
They even sent some bigwigs down to this dock to welcome us.

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:10.730
Seeing how we beat the Side 2 allied space fleet,

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:12.460
I'd expect a welcome!

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:16.160
With the victory of your fleet, Admiral Mutterma Sugan,

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:20.860
it's just a matter of time until Side 2 belongs to Zanscare.

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.800
Him! Uh-oh...

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:25.830
You'll be in a detention center soon, so don't move.

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:31.500
That boy...

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:34.630
Lieutenant, you're in front of the admiral! Don't be rude!

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:35.960
Right! Excuse me!

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:41.130
Once Her Majesty finishes speaking, you can have some time with her.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:43.430
For now, we celebrate our triumphant return.

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:44.030
Sir!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.500
What should I do?

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:48.830
It's like we're heroes, now!

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:51.430
Oh, my goodness! The queen herself is here, too!

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:54.100
The queen?

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:08.360
What do we do if Üso and the others move while we're still waiting in line?

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:09.760
We screwed up.

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:11.660
We shouldn't have moved away from that ship.

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:13.460
That ship was so damaged...

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.060
We never thought they'd bring it into the dock.

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:22.660
Üso ended up in a different dock.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.960
The space colonies of Side 2, having lost this battle,

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:32.200
must now acknowledge that the Zanscare Empire's requests are the most righteous.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:35.860
Today, please return to your homes...

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:39.560
...and rest now with your loving families.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:41.160
Are they looking for me?

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:47.800
If that really is Shahkti's mother...

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:49.430
Hey! You there! Kid!

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:52.230
It's him!

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:54.160
Capture that boy!

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:56.200
Mercy, Your Majesty!

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:05.200
I'm Üso! Üso Ewin! Shahkti's friend!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:06.930
He's with the League Militaire!

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:10.300
This boy? But, he's Shahkti's...

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:13.730
Yes! I'm Üso! I'm worried about Shahkti!

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:16.160
Wait! Don't be rough with him.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.360
This boy is under my protection.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:20.060
Your Majesty, please!

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:23.830
Üso!

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:32.500
Those mobile suits are...

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:35.160
Enemy mobile suits have infiltrated?!

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.400
Where are our defense mobile suits?!

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:40.130
What?! What's that about mobile suits?!

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:42.260
Something's wrong in the port!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:45.200
Looks like Üso's made his move. The port's in chaos.

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:46.760
Time to join in, then! Let's go!

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:49.230
No! Don't go in now!

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:51.260
Hey! Stop working!

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:54.860
It's begun.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.460
Hey, this one's moving!

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:08.200
Get the queen out of here!

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:09.300
Cronicle!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:15.400
That boy... He's the Üso that Shahkti mentioned?

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:21.630
I have no choice now. Miss Peggie, hold on tight!

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:24.530
I'm breaking through. You okay?!

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:26.700
Of course I'm okay.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:27.900
Right.

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:35.360
It's her!

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:05.360
This way, please...

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:07.930
...mother of Shahkti.

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:35.430
Miss Peggie falls in a battle with Cronicle,

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:39.060
and Üso and Miss Marbet end up being captured.

00:23:39.660 --> 00:23:44.330
Odelo and the others see Maria and Üso together,

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:49.300
and the queen must perform an uncanny ritual.

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.860
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:56.330
Next Episode MARIA AND ÜSO
"Maria and Üso".

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:57.660
Please watch it!
